<onlyinclude>'''Algorithm engineering''' is a research and development approach that combines algorithm design, mathematical analysis, implementation and empirical evaluation in a repeated cycle.

== Explanation ==
Two sorting algorithms may have the same asymptotic time complexity but behave differently on actual hardware or input distributions. Algorithm engineering investigates such differences and improves designs using theory and measured evidence.

